      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "两个男人戴着铅面具并排躺着，身边一张字条。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "他们叫米格尔和曼努埃尔，是坎普斯市的电子技师。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "专门给电视台安装信号设备，也修电视和收音机。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "八月十七日，他们对家人说，要去圣保罗买车和仪器。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "可当天下午，他们出现在另一座城市：尼泰罗伊。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "尼泰罗伊郊外，有一座荒凉的小山，叫文廷山。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "八月二十日，一个十八岁的少年上山放风筝。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "爬到山顶，他看见两个人并排躺着，一动不动。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "风筝线从他手里滑落，风筝飘向远处的天空。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "警方赶到现场，拉起警戒线，草地上只有两个人形轮廓。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "他们穿着西装，套着雨衣，身边放着水瓶和毛巾。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "铅灰色的眼罩，倒映着天边的红光。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 73,
      "target_duration": 4,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "笔记写着：十六点三十到达，十八点三十服下胶囊，然后等待信号。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 77,
      "target_duration": 8,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "警局里，探员围着地图争论：是谁把他们叫上山的？",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N05",
