      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "有渔民说，那晚山顶上空，出现过红橙色的光。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 110,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "于是有人说：这是外星人。铅面具，是为了挡住强光。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 117,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "两位技师痴迷实验和神秘学，桌上堆满图纸和旧书。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 124,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "他们在等一个信号——可这只是传闻。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "也有人说，他们在某个团体的指引下，吞下了药物。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 135,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "还有人利用他们对飞碟的兴趣，把他们骗上了山。",
      "sha256": null,
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "用户试听选定的中文男声；悬疑叙事，沉稳有磁性",
